{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670910643553863962","title":"模型优化工程师","description":"1. 负责AI模型的网络级压缩与优化，涵盖量化（QAT/PTQ）、投机采样（Speculative Decoding）、Token压缩、知识蒸馏等技术； \n2. 针对大小模型设计并实现差异化量化方案，如小模型的KL散度、Percentile、AdaRound等，大模型的SmoothQuant、AWQ等； \n3. 参与模型网络结构的优化与重构，将现有网络的算子、Block替换为高效、硬件友好的架构； \n4. 参与模型训练与微调，能够复现、分析并改进前沿模型结构； \n5. 与硬件团队紧密合作，提供模型优化视角的硬件设计建议，推动下一代芯片对新型算子与网络结构的支持。","requirement":"1. 计算机科学、人工智能、数学等相关专业硕士及以上学历；\n2. 深入理解模型量化技术（PTQ/QAT），至少熟悉一种小模型或大模型量化方案，并有实际部署经验；\n3. 熟悉大模型推理优化技术，如投机采样、Token剪枝、稀疏化等；\n4. 具备较强的模型训练与复现能力，能够阅读论文并快速实现网络结构改进；\n5. 了解芯片计算特性；\n6. 代码能力强，熟练使用PyTorch/TensorFlow等框架，熟悉底层算子开发（如CUDA kernel）者更佳。","city_info":{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","i18n_name":"上海"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786023174191,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7670910643553683738","city_list":[{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":